 the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qx4HXki6w0YQ7kNvwHdle3U&_nc_oc=Adle7-QoX_pNwNMez_iVr5t7ThYVkI-QGKu_n92y7uzheWQsqIPovU6MGZYaFdwSwzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyn5fRpXwyUO-1h744GEzitOp60JaBtLb6-YRU6GBKHMw&oe=69AAC12A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p92RV78gGbUQ7kNvwHujTpQ&_nc_oc=AdnG_zRv6EHxTZQrBk4DZUxQiHCBmLwmqaoUtnFjs2MS6bMNdtP2Lm-27IJXOWJWFYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwRsCT2vO0dzOmPHr_DQpwJKJieRBByQqOfYWdgks9H1g&oe=69AAD3DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1emxghfopCMQ7kNvwG3vI5d&_nc_oc=AdkAHbcbUgKVR_BddYDERh7DYJA7pjpKFcWUI9UO2pZ_7rH8NEbmR6Pm_rt9ipjTatI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx7Lm2ZJ0DcdjF_aw6SonjOCC4PirzAKfQijX3HTbwMCA&oe=69AAC2B1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1